敵人造成60%攻擊力的<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素傷害</color>。","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_PlayerWind_05","linkedConstellations":null,"advancedProps":[{"name":"Wind Blade","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"36","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]},"5":{"skillId":722,"type":2,"name":"復甦之風","description":"用<color=#FFD780FF>風渦劍</color>打敗敵人後的5秒內，每秒恢復2%生命值。\\n該效果每5秒只能觸發一次。","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_PlayerWind_06","linkedConstellations":null},"9":{"skillId":751,"type":2,"name":"異邦的烈風","description":"從過往的旅途中，汲取全新的力量。每與一種元素進行過共鳴，便會獲得額外的{LINK#N10050001}<color=#FFD780FF>強化效果</color>{/LINK}。\\n\\n此外，隊伍中附近的角色元素類型為<color=#FF9999FF>火元素</color>、<color=#80C0FFFF>水元素</color>、<color=#99FFFFFF>冰元素</color>或<color=#FFACFFFF>雷元素</color>的攻擊命中敵人時，旅行者將獲得1層對應元素類型的「晨風之刃」，每種元素類型的「晨風之刃」至多疊加1層。擁有至少2層「晨風之刃」時進行重擊，會消耗所有的「晨風之刃」，轉為進行特殊的<color=#FFD780FF>重擊·風旋</color>。\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>重擊·風旋</color>\\n·每段重擊將造成傷害更高的<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素傷害</color>，傷害提升相當於旅行者攻擊力的60%。\\n·每消耗一種元素類型的「晨風之刃」，便會捲起一陣對應元素類型的劍風，造成相當於旅行者攻擊力50%的對應元素傷害，該傷害視為重擊傷害。\\n·每15秒至多進行一次<color=#FFD780FF>重擊·風旋</color>。\\n·進行<color=#FFD780FF>重擊·風旋</color>期間，不會獲得「晨風之刃」。","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_PlayerWind_07","effects":["N10050001"],"linkedConstellations":null}},"constellation":{"0":{"id":0,"talentId":71,"name":"迴轉的怒風","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>風渦劍</color>可將周圍5公尺內的敵人與物體緩慢牽引到角色面前。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_PlayerWind_01"},"1":{"id":1,"talentId":72,"name":"革新的旋風","description":"元素充能效率提升16%。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_PlayerWind_02"},"2":{"id":2,"talentId":73,"name":"天地的剛風","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>風息激盪</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":{"addTalentExtraLevel":{"talentType":"AvatarSkill","talentIndex":9,"extraLevel":3}},"icon":"UI_Talent_U_PlayerWind_02"},"3":{"id":3,"talentId":74,